{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031","title":"为Qwen4提前选设备？Qwen3.8 27B、Flash-Next本地部署选购指南","date":"2026-10-31","updated":"2026-10-31","summary":"从27B、Flash-Next到9B与4B，按容量、带宽、引擎和整机成本比较设备。附本期33项候选及2026年10月30日报价快照。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-本地部署","name":"本地部署","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/cover-880fe11d9e.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"为Qwen4提前选设备？Qwen3.8 27B、Flash-Next本地部署选购指南","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<p>想跑本地大模型，最容易先看显卡名字和价格：预算够不够上新卡，是否一步到位买大内存Mac？我更愿意先把顺序倒过来：你准备运行哪份模型文件，想保留多长的对话，能接受怎样的等待，再决定买哪台设备。</p>\n<p>Qwen4放在这里，是为后续模型提前做设备功课；本期没有Qwen4本地实测或兼容性验证，实际依据是视频中的四组模型：Qwen3.8 27B、Qwen3.8 Flash-Next、Qwen3.5 9B和4B。设备与报价来自本期资料，价格是2026年10月30日所选京东SKU的采集快照，包含裸卡、整机、二手及带条件优惠，不能直接当作当前到手价。公开性能记录会注明相应软件与配置，没有测试的设备不冒充我逐台实测。</p>\n<h2>先问装不装得下，再问用起来快不快</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-capacity-121573e57e.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/a2002e93bb9c2d12ddb25996-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/a2002e93bb9c2d12ddb25996-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-capacity-121573e57e.jpg\" alt=\"容量与带宽的区别\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>内存容量像桌面面积，决定这一摞资料能不能放下；带宽像把资料搬上桌的通道，决定搬得有多快。两张卡都写着24GB，不代表生成速度一样。反过来，一台机器带宽很高，也不能凭空装进超出容量的权重和运行缓冲。</p>\n<p>权重文件之外，还要给上下文缓存、运行过程和其他模块留空间。上下文缓存可以理解成当前对话的随手笔记：聊天拉长，笔记也会增多。同一台机器能启动模型，与能长期维持你需要的对话长度，是两个要分别检查的使用条件。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-xt-fe550f6033.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/ad7124f65f6b9b5541fc13d3-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/ad7124f65f6b9b5541fc13d3-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-xt-fe550f6033.jpg\" alt=\"20GB显存与权重空间\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>片中用约16.46GB的四比特文件说明27B的容量安排。这里只是具体量化文件，不是“所有27B都只占这么多”。购买前先下载或查看你要使用的那份权重清单，再核对引擎、缓存格式和上下文设置，不要只凭模型名字推预算。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-n5-916a904888.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/4a59add34c37b4e1fe95ec58-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/4a59add34c37b4e1fe95ec58-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-n5-916a904888.jpg\" alt=\"内存与系统存储不要混读\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>还有一种坑藏在商品选项里：片中N5 MAX所选项写着“64G+128GB”，实际是64GB内存与128GB系统存储，并不是192GB内存。硬盘负责长期存文件，内存负责当前运行，名字相近也不能相加。选SKU时看参数明细，别只看按钮上的一行字。</p>\n<h2>Qwen3.8 27B：24GB旧卡、大内存整机和新旗舰，各买到什么</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-xtx-f6809c0ea9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/133bc336b5e39fc590f259c5-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/133bc336b5e39fc590f259c5-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-xtx-f6809c0ea9.jpg\" alt=\"7900 XTX公开测试条件\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>20GB的7900 XT和24GB的7900 XTX，适合从已有主机和预算出发比较。片中对应样例是5599元与6998元，都是裸卡价。7900 XTX的官方规格为24GB显存、最高960GB/s带宽；它不等于片中每秒约76词元的测试成绩。后者来自开发者记录，绑定三比特优化包、ROCm后端、多词元预测及短提示条件。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.amd.com/en/products/graphics/desktops/radeon/7000-series/amd-radeon-rx-7900xtx.html\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://www.amd.com/en/products/graphics/desktops/radeon/7000-series/amd-radeon-rx-7900xtx.html\">查看AMD原厂规格</a>可以确认硬件参数；<a href=\"https://github.com/victoralcazardev/rx7900xtx-local-llm\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/victoralcazardev/rx7900xtx-local-llm\">查看对应开发者记录</a>才是了解那次性能结果的入口。把这两类证据分开，选卡时才不会误把标称带宽换算成出字速度。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-3090-7a5ae5eecc.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/c00f5d1e6b02f3a396276a2e-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/c00f5d1e6b02f3a396276a2e-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-3090-7a5ae5eecc.jpg\" alt=\"3090的软件选择与旧卡成本\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>3090同样是24GB，主要吸引力之一是CUDA软件选择较多，但片中二手样例11800元并不天然比前面的方案更划算。旧卡状态、电源、散热和售后都要一起算。4090与5090 D v2的片中样例仍是24GB：升级了算力和带宽，模型能容纳多少却没有按价格同比增加。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-air-d47fbaae01.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b8478f5a4466232ebad1a1dc-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b8478f5a4466232ebad1a1dc-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-air-d47fbaae01.jpg\" alt=\"便携与持续负载一起看\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>想带着走，MacBook Air的轻便、安静与统一内存有吸引力；统一内存是系统与处理器、图形处理器共用的一池空间，不是全部都能留给模型。片中32GB Air与64GB N5 MAX、32GB显存R9700对应不同取舍，不适合只把容量排个高低就直接下单。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-r9700-b537788c82.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/b3df06b0f95410cdac98fb22-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/b3df06b0f95410cdac98fb22-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-r9700-b537788c82.jpg\" alt=\"更大容量不自动带来更高带宽\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>R9700给到32GB显存，带宽却低于片中的7900 XTX。这正好把问题说清楚：如果原本卡在装不下，更大容量能解决问题；如果已经装得下，速度还要看引擎实际表现。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-5090-7411c30b0e.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/fa4bba9e44d7190c18194ffc-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/fa4bba9e44d7190c18194ffc-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-5090-7411c30b0e.jpg\" alt=\"旗舰卡也要对应具体引擎\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>全球版5090的32GB确实同时增加容量和带宽，但片中引用的长上下文案例，在不同引擎、单卡和双卡条件下表现并不相同。已经有24GB卡的人，我更建议先核对目标权重和软件路线，再决定换卡到底解决什么，而不是为了更新的编号重复付钱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备／所选配置</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>带宽口径</th>\n<th>快照价与范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>RX 7900 XT 20GB</td>\n<td>20GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>800GB/s</td>\n<td>5,599元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RX 7900 XTX 24GB</td>\n<td>24GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>960GB/s</td>\n<td>6,998元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 3090 24GB</td>\n<td>24GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>936GB/s</td>\n<td>11,800元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MacBook Air M5 32GB</td>\n<td>32GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>153GB/s</td>\n<td>13,673元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铭凡N5 MAX AI Max 395 64GB</td>\n<td>64GB 共享系统内存</td>\n<td>273.056GB/s</td>\n<td>15,599元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Radeon AI PRO R9700 32GB</td>\n<td>32GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>640GB/s</td>\n<td>17,899元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 4090 24GB</td>\n<td>24GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>1008GB/s</td>\n<td>27,799元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YOGA Pro15 RTX Spark 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>未核实／按配置</td>\n<td>41,284元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 5090 D v2 24GB</td>\n<td>24GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>1344GB/s</td>\n<td>44,892元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 5090全球版32GB</td>\n<td>32GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>1792GB/s</td>\n<td>59,649元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>2026-10-30所选SKU快照；性能需看正文中的具体权重和引擎。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Flash-Next：小显存能运行，前提是把整套搭配写全</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-flash-fa64d4c4d4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/9ab6a3f76e5a49312b12ef33-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/9ab6a3f76e5a49312b12ef33-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-flash-fa64d4c4d4.jpg\" alt=\"参数放置与整机搭配\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>Flash-Next的常规四比特文件在本期资料中约94～111GB。看到这个量级，先别急着把“小显存能跑”的记录当成矛盾：有些方案会让参数分布在显卡、主机内存甚至硬盘。就像常翻的资料放桌上，不常翻的留在柜子里，桌子可以小一点，来回搬运的成本却不能忽略。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-existing-d505a4613c.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/501d3ed6976eb099e76afe92-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/501d3ed6976eb099e76afe92-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-existing-d505a4613c.jpg\" alt=\"已有设备先试，不把新增费用当整机价\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>如果你已经有128GB内存台式机，先用现有设备试，新增硬件费可以是零。这不是一台整机免费；也不代表相同容量的DDR4和DDR5主机会有相同速度。已有64GB M5 Pro，也可以先研究匹配的Splash量化与草稿模型，不必先把旧设备判死刑。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-splash-c6bbfe6b94.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/bb0783dd787b8d48966ce5d9-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/bb0783dd787b8d48966ce5d9-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-splash-c6bbfe6b94.jpg\" alt=\"Splash记录要连同权重和提示条件阅读\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>片中的Splash约95词元／秒，是开发者在对应M5 Pro、Q2包与草稿模型条件下的短提示记录。草稿模型可以理解成先写一个候选答案，再由主模型校验，省下部分逐字生成的等待；它和降低权重精度并不是同一种优化。部署入口与当前支持格式，可查<a href=\"https://github.com/incoai/splash\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/incoai/splash\">Splash项目说明</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-p40-3d1f81dac2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/e22bc41620b71209ff2b6083-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/e22bc41620b71209ff2b6083-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-p40-3d1f81dac2.jpg\" alt=\"P40便宜的是卡，不是整套部署\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>P40裸卡样例1850元很抓眼，但片中的Strata测试还配了约98GB主机内存、对应CUDA环境与专门构建。3060那条路线同样要把64GB主机内存和NVMe硬盘放进成本表，不能只买一张12GB显卡就期待复现整套结果。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-3060-5d80dbb18d.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/eb9ce64852f662567e30e27d-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/eb9ce64852f662567e30e27d-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-3060-5d80dbb18d.jpg\" alt=\"3060需连同内存、硬盘与量化文件比较\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>同一台3060主机，片中引用的Q2与三比特包记录就有明显速度差别。因此，看一张“多少词元／秒”的图时，至少同时留下卡、内存、量化包、提示长度和首字时间。想照着复现，先查<a href=\"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata\">Strata项目及其测试记录入口</a>，不要只抄结果数字。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-evo-683aee94cf.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/898ce500f3ee23e0549e2443-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/898ce500f3ee23e0549e2443-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-evo-683aee94cf.jpg\" alt=\"128GB共享内存整机\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>如果不想拼装主机和处理旧卡，128GB共享内存整机提供了另一种选择。片中EVO-X3与ProArt创13都使用AI Max 395平台，桌面和笔记本的差价还包含便携、持续功耗、散热与整机设计。相同处理器名字，也不能省掉具体SKU核对。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-studio-1c12a9fdd7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/399a51cb25be4ecc69541757-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/399a51cb25be4ecc69541757-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-studio-1c12a9fdd7.jpg\" alt=\"Mac Studio须核对具体GPU核心版本\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>Mac Studio与MacBook Pro也要看具体M5 Max档位。片中40核GPU版本标称614GB/s，32核版本是另一档；只认“M5 Max”四个字，容易把不同配置混在一起。容量通常在购买时决定，后续升级空间也要提前算进选择。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-spark-d9b7d5a36d.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/73d53c4cfe887cced994cffe-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/73d53c4cfe887cced994cffe-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-spark-d9b7d5a36d.jpg\" alt=\"DGX Spark的环境与维护成本\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>DGX Spark这类整机还有开发环境和已有部署方案的价值，但片中专用vLLM路线包含权重、映射和补丁条件。更贵的整机并不会自动抹掉维护工作；你要买的是能持续完成自己任务的一整条路线。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备／所选配置</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>带宽口径</th>\n<th>快照价与范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>已有128GB台式机</td>\n<td>128GB 系统内存</td>\n<td>未核实／按配置</td>\n<td>0元 · 已有设备新增费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已有M5 Pro 64GB与Splash</td>\n<td>64GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>307GB/s</td>\n<td>0元 · 已有设备新增费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tesla P40 24GB与Strata</td>\n<td>24GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>346GB/s</td>\n<td>1,850元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 3060 12GB与Strata</td>\n<td>12GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>360GB/s</td>\n<td>2,319元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 5060 Ti 16GB与Strata</td>\n<td>16GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>448GB/s</td>\n<td>7,452元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EVO-X3 AI Max 395 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 共享系统内存</td>\n<td>256GB/s</td>\n<td>21,599元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProArt创13 AI Max 395 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 共享系统内存</td>\n<td>256GB/s</td>\n<td>23,499元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mac Studio M5 Max 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>614GB/s</td>\n<td>40,040元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MacBook Pro M5 Max 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>614GB/s</td>\n<td>51,732元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DGX Spark 128GB</td>\n<td>128GB 统一系统内存</td>\n<td>273GB/s</td>\n<td>52,734元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“已有设备”按新增硬件费计；裸卡路线还需主机内存、存储、电源与散热。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>量化、裁剪、草稿加速与分层加载，别混成一种“神优化”</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-variants-e4337941af.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/c0b60683934470a9ccc9ebd8-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/c0b60683934470a9ccc9ebd8-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-variants-e4337941af.jpg\" alt=\"几种优化的取舍不同\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>量化主要改变参数用多少位来表示；裁剪会改变保留哪些部分；草稿加速是在生成过程中先猜再校验。片中还特别区分了面向代码的Coder分支和保留全部专家的原版量化。日常中文、长文和通用问答，不能直接照搬代码任务里的选择。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-offload-bb6e461fd7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/08befc72cac27db70a6ad3cf-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/08befc72cac27db70a6ad3cf-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-offload-bb6e461fd7.jpg\" alt=\"装得下、首字与持续生成分开验收\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>分层加载又是另一种安排：把当前需要的一层搬进来，算完再换下一层。它有机会降低显存门槛，代价可能落到硬盘容量、数据搬运和等待。片中AirLLM的低显存记录适合说明“可以启动”的路线，不能只看显存数字就推导出聊天很流畅。</p>\n<p>这也是我建议的验收顺序：先确认模型能加载，再看首字需要等多久，最后看持续生成和长对话是否仍然可用。三项分开记，比只截一个峰值速度更接近买回家以后的体验。</p>\n<h2>预算再低，就先缩小模型，不一定先换电脑</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-p100-76093e8ef5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/e7ebfbdc6f1f1cc9804a264a-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/e7ebfbdc6f1f1cc9804a264a-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-p100-76093e8ef5.jpg\" alt=\"退役计算卡的低价与维护要求\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>本期Qwen3.5 9B四比特文件约5.68GB，4B约2.74GB，开始接近更多现有设备可尝试的范围。P100样例638元有16GB显存，但退役计算卡的驱动、供电、散热仍要自己解决。便宜卡价不适合替代整机成本，更不适合省掉旧硬件状态检查。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-n100-4aacaeb5a8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/7f9d8e6e9bf47b781f57909c-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/7f9d8e6e9bf47b781f57909c-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-n100-4aacaeb5a8.jpg\" alt=\"小电脑也要核对内存通道\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>N100小主机的整机价格更容易算，但内存通道和实际频率会影响体验。9B等得太久时，先试4B，可能比继续加预算更贴近“先用起来”的目标。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-arc-c458ea9a73.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/89c2c25248070df7243a1a90-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/89c2c25248070df7243a1a90-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-arc-c458ea9a73.jpg\" alt=\"Intel Arc的软件适配\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>Intel Arc B580、A770与不同代显卡，也各有容量和软件适配取舍。先确认所选后端支持具体架构和模型，再看显存、带宽与报价。不能用一家平台上的成绩替另一家作保证。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-laptop-28d56ee2cf.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/d7d767d522ce77edb528fe14-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/d7d767d522ce77edb528fe14-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-laptop-28d56ee2cf.jpg\" alt=\"主机内存不能直接加成高速显存\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>笔记本尤其容易把两个容量相加：32GB主机内存加12GB独立显存，不是44GB同速显存。片中蛟龙16 Pro的路线还要连同插电、风扇和持续负载看；轻薄Arm本则要确认软件实际调用的是CPU、GPU还是NPU。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备／所选配置</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>带宽口径</th>\n<th>快照价与范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Tesla P100 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB HBM2独立显存</td>\n<td>732GB/s</td>\n<td>638元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N100 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB 系统内存</td>\n<td>38.4GB/s</td>\n<td>2,069元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Arc B580 12GB</td>\n<td>12GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>456GB/s</td>\n<td>3,199元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intel Arc A770 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>560GB/s</td>\n<td>3,369元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RTX 4060 Ti 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>288GB/s</td>\n<td>4,599元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惠普战66 H255 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB 系统内存</td>\n<td>未核实／按配置</td>\n<td>4,811元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RX 9070 XT 16GB</td>\n<td>16GB 独立显存</td>\n<td>640GB/s</td>\n<td>7,506元 · 裸卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>华硕灵耀14 Air X2 Elite 32GB</td>\n<td>32GB 共享系统内存</td>\n<td>152GB/s</td>\n<td>11,424元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蛟龙16 Pro RTX 5070 Ti</td>\n<td>12GB 独立显存；另32GB系统内存</td>\n<td>672GB/s</td>\n<td>12,627元 · 整机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MI50 32GB补充候选</td>\n<td>32GB HBM2独立显存</td>\n<td>1000GB/s</td>\n<td>未采到准确报价 · 未采到准确价格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>旧卡和第三方定制板型应另核实成色、频率、质保、驱动及散热；无准确报价的候选不补造价格。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-phone-a74d5362db.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/715b2062d7fee9271be559aa-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/715b2062d7fee9271be559aa-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-phone-a74d5362db.jpg\" alt=\"已有手机的新增硬件费用\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-pi-e0e42235a6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/cc90ab91b495b58a5659e288-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/cc90ab91b495b58a5659e288-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-pi-e0e42235a6.jpg\" alt=\"树莓派5与存储配套\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-jetson-79b81c3617.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/65f7823d878f460504db4a47-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/65f7823d878f460504db4a47-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"/obsidian-assets/local-llm-hardware-guide-20261031/image-jetson-79b81c3617.jpg\" alt=\"Jetson开发套件\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>已有安卓手机，可以先用兼容应用和合适的小模型试短对话；树莓派和Jetson适合各自的学习、边缘部署与项目用途。前者的电源套餐价不包含所有存储与机箱，后者也要选对软件与性能模式。只为体验聊天，从零购买开发板未必比先用现有电脑更合适。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设备／所选配置</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>带宽口径</th>\n<th>快照价与范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>已有安卓手机</td>\n<td>按具体机型</td>\n<td>未核实／按配置</td>\n<td>0元 · 已有设备新增费用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>树莓派5 8GB</td>\n<td>8GB 共享系统内存</td>\n<td>17GB/s</td>\n<td>1,839元 · 开发板电源套餐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jetson Orin Nano Super 8GB</td>\n<td>8GB 统一内存</td>\n<td>102GB/s</td>\n<td>3,969元 · 开发套件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>手机按已有设备新增费用计；开发板套餐与配套范围以快照记录为准。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>下单前，把这份配置说明写完整</h2>\n<p>先写目标模型的准确文件名与量化版本，再写所用引擎、所需上下文和能接受的等待。接着核对整机内存、显存、硬盘、电源、散热与平台支持，最后再用当前商品页确认SKU和到手价。能借到、已有的设备，先试一次自己的真实任务。</p>\n<p>如果主要需求只是短对话与轻任务，小模型能完成，就不必为了一个更大的参数名先买新电脑。如果确实要长期跑更大模型，再看专用部署方案能否复现、维护起来是否愿意承担。真正要比较的，是整套可用方案的成本，而不是一张显卡的名字。个人观点，仅供参考。</p>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:mac-local-inference-engines","rawId":"obsidian:mac-local-inference-engines","slug":"mac-local-inference-engines","legacyPaths":[],"title":"都说比 Ollama 快，可没人真跟 Ollama 比过","date":"2026-09-05","updated":"2026-10-31","summary":"Ollama 半年前就把 Mac 推理换成了 MLX 内核，现在冒出一堆自称更快的挑战者。我没跑实测，只把四家自己公布的跑分摆到一张桌子上——结果是：谁也没跟谁跑同一套题。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-本地部署","name":"本地部署","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"/obsidian-assets/mac-local-inference-engines/cover-ca31df9eff.png","cover":"/obsidian-assets/mac-local-inference-engines/cover-ca31df9eff.png","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"都说比 Ollama 快，可没人真跟 Ollama 比过","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/mac-local-inference-engines.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:localbrain-security-architecture","rawId":"obsidian:localbrain-security-architecture","slug":"localbrain-security-architecture","legacyPaths":[],"title":"方寸智匣 2.0.7 能自己做安全测试了？本地大模型10分2秒挖出越权漏洞","date":"2026-10-21","updated":"2026-10-21","summary":"权限在程序、调查在模型：本地大模型 10 分 2 秒独立完成授权安全检查，25 轮 32 次工具调用挖出真实越权漏洞，修复后复测闭环。怎么实现的、模型是什么角色、破坏力边界在哪，一篇讲清。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}]